OL,3,GNEWSACouncil scraps parking charges for
OL,4,Afestive period
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council in Derbyshire is set to scrap
OL,7,Fparking charges for an entire month in
OL,8,Fa bid to attract shoppers and tourists.
OL,10,FErewash Borough Council said it was
OL,11,Foffering free parking across
OL,12,Fauthority-run car parks, including the
OL,13,FLong Eaton train station, from 1
OL,14,FDecember until 4 January to help boost
OL,15,Ftrade ahead of Christmas.
OL,17,FThe incentive comes after the
OL,18,Fauthority, which introduced the same
OL,19,Fscheme last Christmas, made its car
OL,20,Fparks free to use at weekends in April.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
